_pdbx_entry_details.compound_details         
;THE F-TYPE ATPASES HAVE 2 COMPONENTS,
     F1 - THE CATALYTIC CORE
 AND F0 - THE MEMBRANE PROTON CHANNEL.
  F1 HAS FIVE SUBUNITS:
    ALPHA(3), BETA(3), GAMMA(1), DELTA(1), EPSILON(1).
  F0 HAS THREE MAIN SUBUNITS:
  A, B AND C.
 THE DBREF, SEQRES AND ATOM RECORDS GIVE THE BOVINE AND E.COLI
 MODEL COORDINATES AND SEQUENCE AS:
 THE TRUE YEAST PROTEINS ARE: WHILE THE MODELS USED ARE:
